  "description": "Bring a festive and joyful Christmas vibe to your craft projects with our Custom Name Christmas Ornament Laser Cut Bundle! This beautiful bundle includes 12 unique Christmas ornament designs, perfect for personalization, holiday gifts, Christmas decorations, and DIY projects. Ideal for laser cutting, CNC machines, Cricut, Silhouette, and a wide range of creative ornament, home décor, gift, and Christmas-themed craft projects. \nEach design is carefully crafted for clean, smooth cuts and delivers beautiful results on wood, acrylic, MDF, cardstock, leather, and more.\nEach of the 12 ornament designs is included in two versions: a ready-made version with sample names and a blank version without names, so you can easily add your own custom text and create personalized Christmas ornaments.\nWhat you’ll get (High-Quality Formats):\n12 SVG – scalable & cutting machine-ready\n12 EPS – professional vector format\n12 PNG – 300 DPI high-resolution\n12 DXF – compatible with laser cutting machines\n12 PDF – easy to print & preview\n12 AI – fully editable in Adobe Illustrator\nPerfect for:\nChristmas tree ornaments, personalized ornaments, custom name ornaments, holiday gifts, festive decorations, Christmas home décor, gift tags, wooden ornaments, acrylic ornaments, door decorations, party favors, craft fairs, DIY Christmas projects, small business products, and creative handmade holiday crafts.\nThank you for visiting our store!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bring a festive and joyful Christmas vibe to your craft projects with our Custom Name Christmas Ornament Laser Cut Bundle! This beautiful bundle includes 12 unique Christmas ornament designs, perfect for personalization, holiday gifts, Christmas decorations, and DIY projects. Ideal for laser cutting, CNC machines, Cricut, Silhouette, and a wide range of creative ornament, home décor, gift, and Christmas-themed craft projects. </p>\n<p>Each design is carefully crafted for clean, smooth cuts and delivers beautiful results on wood, acrylic, MDF, cardstock, leather, and more.</p>\n<p>Each of the 12 ornament designs is included in two versions: a ready-made version with sample names and a blank version without names, so you can easily add your own custom text and create personalized Christmas ornaments.</p>\n<p>What you’ll get (High-Quality Formats):<br>\n12 SVG – scalable &amp; cutting machine-ready<br>\n12 EPS – professional vector format<br>\n12 PNG – 300 DPI high-resolution<br>\n12 DXF – compatible with laser cutting machines<br>\n12 PDF – easy to print &amp; preview<br>\n12 AI – fully editable in Adobe Illustrator<br>\nPerfect for:</p>\n<p>Christmas tree ornaments, personalized ornaments, custom name ornaments, holiday gifts, festive decorations, Christmas home décor, gift tags, wooden ornaments, acrylic ornaments, door decorations, party favors, craft fairs, DIY Christmas projects, small business products, and creative handmade holiday crafts.</p>\n<p>Thank you for visiting our store!</p>",
